{"name":"Body makeup / leg makeup","deep":true,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_%2817659375763%29.jpg/960px-Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_%2817659375763%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_(17659375763).jpg","caption":"Woman with rainbow-hued body makeup (17659375763)","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},"mentions":2,"casual":{"lead":["Body makeup, often sold as leg makeup or bronzer, gives you an even, tanned-looking finish on the day. It covers blemishes and marks and adds colour in a single application, so skin looks smoother in photos and at events.","It works by depositing a temporary tint on the surface of the skin, which is why the result shows immediately and comes off with soap and water. It is used as a quick alternative or add-on to self-tanner. No clinical studies have examined it; the effect is visible straight away."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["People apply it to legs, arms or shoulders shortly before a photo, event or night out, in forms such as powders, sprays, mousses, gels and lotions. It is often used on top of a self-tan for extra depth, and it is removed the same day with soap and water."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Reported drawbacks are rub-off onto clothing, and orange or uneven results if applied unevenly. Some formulations contain allergens such as fragrances or benzyl alcohol, which matters for anyone with sensitive skin."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_%2817659375763%29.jpg/960px-Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_%2817659375763%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_%2817659375763%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Woman with rainbow-hued body makeup (17659375763)","license":"CC BY 2.0","creator":"Hernan Irastorza from Buenos Aires, Argentina","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_with_rainbow-hued_body_makeup_(17659375763).jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/7abea6d2-6f14-470f-8a04-7aa751422f2b/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/801/27162212438_2471687005.jpg","title":"EI Body Makeup Demo","license":"BY-NC-ND 2.0","creator":"California birds & other sights","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/149794246@N06/27162212438","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/9a414256-1ba9-44bf-9552-86bdb5c5bc3c/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/5054/5478449228_233e1637bf_b.jpg","title":"Body Makeup","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"smilemark","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/14238175@N08/5478449228","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/e3e1badf-c2d3-4dfe-b350-50fadae26ab3/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/6050/5899631195_d847b1e6c8_b.jpg","title":"Dancers Applying Body Makeup","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"otts","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/18293878@N00/5899631195","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/6c46d9ba-9e15-48de-86e1-7987425a02c2/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/5258/5478448938_a4c9fef7e8_b.jpg","title":"Body Makeup","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"smilemark","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/14238175@N08/5478448938","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/36a3c188-ce24-4ebc-8125-63037ac04431/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/5174/5478448666_ae6251c070_b.jpg","title":"Body Makeup","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"smilemark","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/14238175@N08/5478448666","source":"Flickr"}],"links":{"s