202","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Flame Free Confession III: Even More Flame Free (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-1/264067","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Anna's Training Log Part 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/annas-training-log-part-2-part-1/258235","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2019"},{"title":"The Stupid Thread 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-stupid-thread-2-part-1/219703","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Trump 2025 - Resuming The National Nightmare Of Peace And Prosperity (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trump-2025-resuming-the-national-nightmare-of-peace-and-prosperity-part-1/289108","site":"T Nation · 9998 posts · 2024"},{"title":"Flame Free Confession III: Even More Flame Free (Part 2)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-2/273731","site":"T Nation · 8490 posts · 2021"},{"title":"The Return of Even More Movies You've Watched This Week III","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-return-of-even-more-movies-youve-watched-this-week-iii/210398","site":"T Nation · 4744 posts · 2015"},{"title":"TM79's Training Journal","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tm79s-training-journal/273630","site":"T Nation · 4246 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Dani's Rebel Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/danis-rebel-log/280747","site":"T Nation · 3979 posts · 2023"},{"title":"Atlas13 Burning the Boats","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/atlas13-burning-the-boats/259312","site":"T Nation · 3714 posts · 2019"},{"title":"US Presidential Election Predictions","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/us-presidential-election-predictions/270025","site":"T Nation · 3253 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Have You Ever Beta Orbited a Girl","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/have-you-ever-beta-orbited-a-girl/248693","site":"T Nation · 3018 posts · 2018"},{"title":"Religion Catch All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/religion-catch-all/268570","site":"T Nation · 2730 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Brute's Book","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/brutes-book/210950","site":"T Nation · 2469 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Queen Cobra's Training Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/queen-cobras-training-log/259558","site":"T Nation · 2382 posts · 2019"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Composition of the human body — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Composition_of_the_human_body"},{"title":"Sunless tanning (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunless_tanning"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Tan & skin tone","chain":["Tint applied to skin","Covers blemishes, evens tone","Smoother, tanned look in photos"],"effect":"direct","text":"Body and leg makeup tints the skin so tone looks even, marks are covered and colour is added for a photo or event. The result is visible immediately and washes off with soap and water, so it works as a same-day look."},"wikipedia":{"title":"Composition of the human body","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Composition_of_the_human_body"},"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Body makeup, often sold as leg makeup, is a cosmetic applied to the skin of the body to even out tone, cover blemishes or add colour for a photo or event. It belongs to the family of temporary tints and bronzers, which wash off with soap and water.[1]","Encyclopedic sources describe bronzers as available in powders, sprays, mousses, gels, lotions and moisturizers, often used for a one-day tan or alongside dihydroxyacetone (DHA) self-tanner. Reported drawbacks include rub-off onto clothing, and an orange or splotchy look if applied unevenly.[1]","No published trials have tested body makeup for appearance outcomes, so its effect rests on the product descriptions and on user experience."],"infobox":[["Type","Topical cosmetic (temporary tint)"],["Forms","Powder, spray, mousse, gel, lotion"],["Duration","Until washed off[1]"],["Regulation","Cosmetic"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Temporary bronzing and tinting products colour only the surface of the skin and do not involve the chemical reaction that DHA self-tanners use.[1] Some bronzers also contain a gradual tanning agent, so the colour builds with repeated use.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Reported risks and drawbacks","paras":["Listed drawbacks include transfer onto clothing and uneven results. Some formulations contain potential allergens such as benzyl alcohol, tocopherol and fragrances.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Sunless tanning","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunless_tanning","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"All darker indians NEED to use bronzer","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/all-darker-indians-need-to-use-bronzer.510297/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220701225741/https://looksmax.org/threads/all-darker-indians-need-to-use-bronzer.510297/"},{"title":"Looksmax You can pretty much change your entire face with bronzer and contour + fake tan","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/you-can-pretty-much-change-your-entire-face-with-bronzer-and-contour-fake-tan.278190/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230609125839/https://looksmax.org/threads/you-can-pretty-much-change-your-entire-face-with-bronzer-and-contour-fake-tan.278190/"},{"title":"Just. Don't. Suck (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/just-dont-suck-part-1/228202","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Flame Free Confession III: Even More Flame Free (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-1/264067","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Anna's Training Log Part 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/annas-training-log-part-2-part-1/258235","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2019"},{"title":"The Stupid Thread 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-stupid-th